  "message_id": "MSG_999",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞人偶正盯着这边……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e703_128.bf.json:1:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 E7 02}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}这人偶……\n总觉得有点像天城呢。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e703_128.bf.json:2:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 06 01 0B 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 26 04}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}咦，不会吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e703_128.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 09 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}虽然我不太想看它……\n不过，只是头发都是黑的吧？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e703_128.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}啊，不是。\n天城当老板娘的时候就是这感觉。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e703_128.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 06 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 0D 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 8F 11}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}……老板娘？\n你家是开旅馆的吗？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e703_128.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 06 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}啊，是的。\n我家经营着一家老字号温泉旅馆，\n叫作天城屋旅馆。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e703_128.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 07 01 01 01 01 01 F5 02}{F5 86 07 01 03 01 65 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 F8 04}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}温泉！\n真好啊。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e703_128.bf.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 01 01 08 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 6B 03}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}嗯……好想暖和一下……\n现在就想暖和一下……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e703_128.bf.json:9:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 02 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 07 01 0D 01 65 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 F6 04}哎，学长！\n下次大家一起去\n天城屋旅馆玩吧！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e703_128.bf.json:10:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 02 01 03 01 21 01 01 01}{F1 25}{F5 C1 0F 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}　\n{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 60 11}就这么办吧。\n月高组的各位，有空也一起来。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e703_128.bf.json:11:0",
  "message_id": "SEL_010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 0C 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 03 01 02 01 01 01 02 01}可以吗？{F5 47 02 01 03 01 09 01 21 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e703_128.bf.json:11:1",
  "message_id": "SEL_010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}等我们逃出去以后吧{F5 47 02 01 03 01 01 01 21 01}{00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e703_128.bf.json:12:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 06 01 05 01 05 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 3D 04}嗯，当然。\n我会准备好大房间的。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e703_128.bf.json:13:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0E 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 02 0A}是啊。\n一切都得等逃出去之后再说。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e703_128.bf.json:14:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_013",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0C 01 01 01 04 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 9A 08}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}好，又多了件值得期待的事！\n这下干劲十足了！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e703_128.bf.json:15:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_014",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 06 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}啊，不过没有混浴哦？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e703_128.bf.json:16:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_015",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0C 01 03 01 03 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 89 11}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}怎、怎么这样……！\n我明明还什么都没说……！？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 }
